(7719205, 1269743, 97435, '<td valign="top">Happy to see that some people enjoyed the photo! :)<br/> <br/>Unfortunately I only had about 20 minutes for after-processing, and in those 20 minutes I also had to learn how to focus stack pictures in Photoshop lol<br/> <br/>Apart from the yellow cast, I''m pretty happy with the photo. I kept the cans, will try to find a better composition / setup.<br/> <br/>---------------------<br/> <br/>The idea is not mine, btw. If you''re curious, just google "beer cans singing" :)</td>', 'Happy to see that some people enjoyed the photo! :) Unfortunately I only had about 20 minutes for after-processing, and in those 20 minutes I also had to learn how to focus stack pictures in Photoshop lol Apart from the yellow cast, I''m pretty happy with the photo. I kept the cans, will try to find a better composition / setup. --------------------- The idea is not mine, btw. If you''re curious, just google "beer cans singing" :)', '2022-04-25 21:05:59.000000', NULL, 0),
